OL,3,GNEWSANine-month extension for permit
OL,4,Aholders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rules governing how long people on
OL,7,Fshort-term employment permits can stay
OL,8,Fin Guernsey have been relaxed.
OL,10,FHome Affairs has announced anyone on a
OL,11,Fthree-year licence can apply for a
OL,12,Fnine-month extension.
OL,14,FCommittee president Marc Leadbeater
OL,15,Fsaid they had made the move as they
OL,16,Fwere "sympathetic" with the challenges
OL,17,Ffaced by employers when it came to work
OL,18,Fpermits.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
