OL,3,GNEWSANine-month extension for permit
OL,4,Aholders
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates chief executive Boley Smillie
OL,7,Fannounced the government's internal
OL,8,Faudit team would be reviewing the work
OL,9,Fof population management after it was
OL,10,Frevealed that as of 17 September, 3,886
OL,11,Fpopulation management applications were
OL,12,Foutstanding, alongside 324 applications
OL,13,Fwithin immigration workstreams.
